            "review_text": "eileent3821\nKuala Lumpur, Malaysia2474 contributions\n0\nBEST HOTPOT IN HO CHI MINH\nApr 2023 • Friends\nA vast variety of food and 6 choices for soup base. My favourite being the Drunken Herbal chicken! Price is cheaper than Singapore’s branches. Order on the iPad and take your sauces from the buffet table with instructions for first timers how to create it. Food comes rather fast, and each server will tell you how many seconds you need to cook the food. They also give you soul refills in 4 bottles which is efficient. Cut fruits available at the Sauces table after a sumptuous dinner. Drinks are refillable. All the waiters and waitresses are very professional and attentive to our needs for a good meal. Kudos to the management especially Willie Peh to hire a team of cheerful individuals!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten June 7, 2023",
