            "review_text": "Mike\nGrantham, United Kingdom58 contributions\n0\nWell over priced\nMay 2023\nDecided to eat at Beauty in the pot, looked at the menu, explained that we would order for two, with the child sharing. How wrong was I!!!\nThe menu was on the I pad said what we wanted for 2, came out at 200,000vd. When getting the bill, showed 380,000vd. All we seem to get for that was a few bits of chicken with bone, a few vegetables in the pot of stock. Then we had to buy other food to add to the pot. This came in very small amounts, and found it disappointing. I actually came away feeling I had not eaten, and hungry. The bill was over 1,000,000vd, which was poor value for money. It's probably aimed at business clients. \nAs for the restaurant, looked very new, nice and clean, service was excellent. Waitresses and waiters very nice and friendly, maybe a little too attentive (could have been the experience was new for me).\nSome good points, some not so good. sorry, not for me\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten May 18, 2023",
